                "para": [
                    [
                        {
                            "id": "50",
                            "text": " Dependency theory is a valuable geographical concept … "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "51",
                            "text": " However, it has continued to receive extensive criticism within the field of development studies. "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "52",
                            "text": " Gulalp (1998) argues that … These critiques pose several questions … "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "50",
                            "text": " Although it offers some rational explanation as to the situation of many developing countries, "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "85",
                            "text": " it fails to offer enough reason and clarity "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "50",
                            "text": " in formulating a holistic development strategy. "
                        }
                    ]
                ],
                "placeHolder": "Type Paragraph 5 here.",
