            },
            "content": {
                "para": [
                    [
                        {
                            "id": "60",
                            "text": " The final point of comment with regards to both of the development theories is how they relate to a wider development paradigm. Both theories emerged chronologically … "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "61",
                            "text": " They both, however, strongly represent what development at that time meant … In this context, the dynamic nature of the entire development thesis renders both modernization and dependency theory of little realistic value, and arguably ineffective as development theories. "
                        }
                    ]
