                "It is used when you need to point out similarities (compare) or differences (contrast) between two or more theories, arguments or ideas. In many essays, you will need to focus on both similarities and differences. The essay will need to show your understanding of the two or more things you are comparing and/or contrasting by referring to research."
            ],
